{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんにちは‪⸜(*ˊᵕˋ*)⸝‬\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n \n \n \n \n だいぶ前ですが、人生で2度目のボルダリングに行ってきたよ〜！！！☺️\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 「人生2度目のボルダリングの旅」\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ36766A7RC2RZC3VMAY6QZR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n よしっ、今から登るぞ〜！！☺️\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ367741AZE6B8BJ1HGWJJ29","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 次の手は〜。\n \n あっ！あそこか！！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ36783TYN5A7JNCMERT5WM4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ここが次の手でしょーーー\n \n ううーーー😵\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ36791EWNK8JVM13S84YT8V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n たぁーーーっ💨\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ367AJ2BJV0PT7AH3FMMKSM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n あーー落ちた。\n 無理でしょーー、これ登れるの？\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 以上、ボルダリングの旅でしたーー☺️☺️\n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"}